I have what I need. Design decisions:

- **Routing**: routes `/`, `/projects`, `/settings` are the pages. The shell is mounted once in a route group layout `src/app/(lumen)/layout.tsx`, and the three pages live in that group. The root `src/app/page.tsx` placeholder must be removed so `/` isn't ambiguous; since I can't delete files, I'll overwrite it to re-export the group's page. Two pages resolving to `/` would be a build error, so the dashboard page will live in `src/app/page.tsx` itself and I'll provide the shell via the root-level layout wrapper for those three paths only.
- **Simplest safe structure**: pages sit in `src/app/(lumen)/projects/page.tsx` and `src/app/(lumen)/settings/page.tsx`. For `/`, `src/app/page.tsx` renders `<LumenShell>` itself, which would remount on navigation. To avoid that, the root `layout.tsx` mounts a client `ShellGate` that renders the shell only for the three Lumen paths and passes children through otherwise, so it mounts once.
- **Brand**: `once-ui.config.js` with `brandSeed` + `brandScale` (#DB2777 as step 600), sand neutral, `defaultTheme: "light"`, `border: "rounded"`; the 16px radius is set once in `custom.css` via the design system's radius tokens.
- **Fonts**: no network; system stacks via `OnceUIFont`-style objects, applied through `--font-heading`/`--font-body` variables in the config's `fonts` and a `<style>` from `custom.css`.

Since `fonts` are consumed in the layout as `.variable` class names (next/font), I'll replace them with plain CSS variables set in `custom.css`, and keep `fonts` exported in the config for compatibility.

Now the files. Config first:

```js src/resources/once-ui.config.js
import { landing } from "./seo";

// Lumen runs on a local domain in demo mode; replace with the production URL.
const baseURL = "https://lumen.example";

/**
 * Fonts: system stacks only, nothing is fetched from the network.
 * Each entry carries the CSS variable Once UI reads. The variables are
 * declared in custom.css (`:root`), so `variable` is just the name.
 * Headings use a rounded system face, body text a plain system sans.
 */
const roundedStack = 'ui-rounded, "SF Pro Rounded", system-ui, sans-serif';
const sansStack = "ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif";
const monoStack = "ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace";

const fonts = {
  heading: { variable: "--font-heading", className: "", style: { fontFamily: roundedStack } },
  body: { variable: "--font-body", className: "", style: { fontFamily: sansStack } },
  label: { variable: "--font-label", className: "", style: { fontFamily: sansStack } },
  code: { variable: "--font-code", className: "", style: { fontFamily: monoStack } },
};

const i18n = {
  locales: ["en"],
};

/**
 * Lumen's identity, carried by the design system's theme config.
 * - Brand #DB2777 is step 600 of the brand ramp (primary buttons, current nav
 *   item, links, focus rings all read the brand scale).
 * - Neutrals are the built-in warm "sand" family.
 * - Light by default; the visitor can still switch (theme stays "system").
 * - `border: "rounded"` plus the 16px radius tokens in custom.css.
 * - Airy: scaling 105 and a larger body size.
 */
const brandScale = {
  100: "#2a0a18",
  200: "#4a0f2b",
  300: "#7a1646",
  400: "#a31d5f",
  500: "#c4216c",
  600: "#db2777",
  700: "#e8559a",
  800: "#f19ac0",
  900: "#f8c4da",
  1000: "#fcdbe8",
  1100: "#fdeaf2",
  1200: "#fff5f9",
  "600-15": "rgba(219,39,119,0.15)",
  "600-30": "rgba(219,39,119,0.3)",
  "600-50": "rgba(219,39,119,0.5)",
};

/** @type {import("@once-ui-system/core").OnceUIStyleConfig} */
const style = {
  theme: "system",
  defaultTheme: "light",
  neutral: "sand",
  brand: "custom",
  accent: "custom",
  brandSeed: "#DB2777",
  accentSeed: "#DB2777",
  brandScale,
  accentScale: brandScale,
  solid: "color",
  solidStyle: "flat",
  border: "rounded",
  surface: "filled",
  transition: "all",
  scaling: "105",
  bodySize: "105",
  bodyLineHeight: "120",
};

const dataStyle = {
  variant: "gradient", // flat | gradient | outline
  mode: "categorical", // categorical | divergent | sequential
  height: 24, // default chart height
  axis: {
    stroke: "var(--neutral-alpha-weak)",
  },
  tick: {
    fill: "var(--neutral-on-background-weak)",
    fontSize: 11,
    line: false,
  },
};

const schema = {
  logo: "",
  type: "Organization",
  name: "Lumen",
  description: landing.home.description,
  email: "hello@lumen.example",
};

/** @type {{ name: string; icon: import("@once-ui-system/core").IconName; link: string }[]} */
const social = [];

export { baseURL, fonts, i18n, style, schema, social, dataStyle };
```

